{
  "id": "acceleration_of_gravity_and_newton_s_second_law",
  "title": "Acceleration of Gravity and Newton's Second Law",
  "description": "Calculate weight, velocity, and distance traveled for free-falling objects using Newton's Second Law and gravitational acceleration.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Acceleration of Gravity and Newton's Second Law\n\nNewton's Second Law for gravity force (weight) is expressed as:\n\n**W = m × g**\n\nWhere:\n- **W** = Weight/Gravity force (N)\n- **m** = Mass (kg)\n- **g** = Acceleration of gravity (9.81 m/s² or 32.174 ft/s²)\n\n### Free Falling Object Calculations\n\n**Velocity:** v = g × t\n\n**Distance:** s = ½ × g × t²\n\n**Time to fall:** t = √(2s / g)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "mass",
          "label": "Mass",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "kg"
        },
        {
          "id": "gravity",
          "label": "Acceleration of Gravity",
          "type": "select",
          "defaultValue": 9.81,
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "SI Units (m/s²)",
              "value": 9.81
            },
            {
              "label": "Imperial Units (ft/s²)",
              "value": 32.174
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "time",
          "label": "Time",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "s"
        },
        {
          "id": "distance",
          "label": "Distance",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0,
          "unit": "m"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "weight",
          "label": "Weight (W = m × g)",
          "formula": "inputs.mass * inputs.gravity",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity",
          "label": "Velocity (v = g × t)",
          "formula": "inputs.gravity * inputs.time",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "distance_fallen",
          "label": "Distance Fallen (s = ½ × g × t²)",
          "formula": "0.5 * inputs.gravity * inputs.time * inputs.time",
          "unit": "m",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "time_to_fall",
          "label": "Time to Fall from Distance (t = √(2s / g))",
          "formula": "inputs.distance > 0 ? Math.sqrt(2 * inputs.distance / inputs.gravity) : 0",
          "unit": "s",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Time (s)",
        "Velocity (m/s)",
        "Distance (m)",
        "Velocity (km/h)",
        "Velocity (ft/s)"
